# LF everywhere — in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout could carry CRLF while git stored LF, and any
# edit produced a whole-file diff: vitre.js once showed 642 changed lines for
# zero content change. Normalizing here means the diff is always the change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
